<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>This online shop is run by @Model.LegalName, @Model.Address. Our contacts are at the bottom of this page. By placing an order or creating an account you agree to these terms.</p>

<h2>Your account</h2>
<p>Give true details and keep your password to yourself. You are responsible for what is done from your account. We may close an account that is used to abuse the shop.</p>

<h2>Orders</h2>
<p>An order is accepted when you receive our confirmation email. We may cancel an order if an item turns out to be unavailable or its price was shown wrongly. We tell you, and any money you paid is returned.</p>

<h2>Prices and stock</h2>
<p>Prices are in Armenian drams (֏) and are the prices on the site when you order. Items are put aside for you when you place the order. Registered customers get @Model.CustomerDiscountPercent% off the regular price; it does not add to a product discount, you get the lower of the two.</p>

<h2>Delivery, payment and returns</h2>
<p>These are described on the <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="Delivery">Delivery &amp; returns</a> page, which is part of these terms.</p>

<h2>About the products</h2>
<p>Photos are for illustration; the colour on your screen may differ a little. We describe the products as the supplier describes them.</p>

<h2>Our responsibility</h2>
<p>We do our best to keep the site working and its information correct. Nothing in these terms limits your rights under the law of Armenia.</p>

<h2>Our content</h2>
<p>The texts, pictures and design of this site belong to us or to the people who allowed us to use them. Please do not copy them without asking.</p>

<h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
<p>We may change these terms. The version on this page when you place an order applies to that order.</p>

<h2>Law and complaints</h2>
<p>These terms follow the law of Armenia. If you are not happy with something, write or call us first; we will try to put it right.</p>
